{"id":"conv_05147","context":"Two managers prep a logistics-route revision memo","ambient":"office_quiet_low","cast":["yuki_office","kenji_office"],"tier":4,"lines":[{"speaker":"yuki_office","mood":null,"en":"Kenji, shall we start the logistics route revision memo with the South Kanto highway section?","jp":"健司さん、この物流ルート改定メモ、まず南関東の高速区間から見直しませんか？","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,14,16,20,26,31,50,54,370,2069,2381,3298,3550,3601,4493,5484,7636,9261,9371,9856],"jpTokens":[{"s":"健司","r":"けんじ"},{"s":"さん","w":50},{"s":"、"},{"s":"この","w":31},{"s":"物流","r":"ぶつりゅう","w":9261},{"s":"ルート","w":3601},{"s":"改定","r":"かいてい","w":5484},{"s":"メモ","w":2381},{"s":"、"},{"s":"まず","w":370},{"s":"南関東","r":"みなみかんとう"},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"高速","r":"こうそく","w":2069},{"s":"区間","r":"くかん","w":9371},{"s":"から","w":20},{"s":"見直し","r":"みなおし","w":7636},{"s":"ませ","w":14},{"s":"ん","w":26},{"s":"か","w":16},{"s":"？"}]},{"speaker":"kenji_office","mood":null,"en":"Agreed. But the issue is whether we keep the existing long-haul contract as is, or cut it here.","jp":"賛成です。ただ、既存の長距離契約をそのままキープするか、ここで一度切るかが論点ですね。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,5,6,7,16,17,19,51,133,247,764,898,1426,1999,2207,2659,3124,4321,4648,8922,9378],"jpTokens":[{"s":"賛成","r":"さんせい","w":2659},{"s":"です","w":17},{"s":"。"},{"s":"ただ","w":247},{"s":"、"},{"s":"既存","r":"きそん","w":3124},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"長距離","r":"ちょうきょり","w":8922},{"s":"契約","r":"けいやく","w":764},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"そのまま","w":898},{"s":"キープ","w":9378},{"s":"する","w":19},{"s":"か","w":16},{"s":"、"},{"s":"ここ","w":133},{"s":"で","w":7},{"s":"一度","r":"いちど","w":1426},{"s":"切る","r":"きる","w":4321},{"s":"か","w":16},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"論点","r":"ろんてん","w":4648},{"s":"です","w":17},{"s":"ね","w":51},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"yuki_office","mood":null,"en":"Any objection to terminating it? If we continue, the fuel surcharge keeps adding up to a huge annual loss.","jp":"切る方向に異論はありますか？継続だと燃料サーチャージが加算され続けて、年間で巨額のロスになります。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,2,